## Minimal Data Model (Keep It Simple)
### Entities
- `task` (1) -> (N) `run`
- `run` (1) -> (N) `run_event` (append-only)
- `run` (N) <-> (N) `library_item` via `run_library_link`
- `library_item` self-links via `superseded_by_id` (never delete)

### ER Diagram (ASCII)

  task 1 -------- N run 1 -------- N run_event
                     \
                      \
                       N
                        \
                         run_library_link (relation: used|created|promoted|superseded)
                        /
                       N
                      /
             library_item  (superseded_by_id -> library_item.id)

### Suggested Tables (Field Sketch)

`task`
- id (uuid)
- title (text)
- workflow_key (text)            -- primary bucket
- goal (text)
- acceptance_criteria (text)
- systems_touched (jsonb)        -- repos/services/db
- risk_level (text)              -- read_only|writes|external_side_effects
- status (text)                  -- open|in_progress|done
- created_at (timestamptz)
- last_touched_at (timestamptz)

`run`
- id (uuid)
- task_id (uuid, fk)
- targets (jsonb)                -- UUID1/2/3
- started_at (timestamptz)
- ended_at (timestamptz)
- status (text)                  -- success|failed|aborted
- summary (text)

`run_event` (append-only)
- id (bigserial)
- run_id (uuid, fk)
- ts (timestamptz)
- type (text)                    -- note|cmd|sql|error|breakthrough|link
- message (text)
- data (jsonb)                   -- {command, stdout, stderr, exit_code, sql, url, ...}
- supersedes_event_id (bigint, nullable)

`library_item`
- id (uuid)
- workflow_key (text)
- kind (text)                    -- recipe|pitfall|decision|checklist
- title (text)
- body_mdc (text)
- tags (jsonb)
- source_refs (jsonb)            -- file paths, issues, commands, etc
- created_at (timestamptz)
- last_used_at (timestamptz)
- promotion_mode (text)          -- auto|user
- superseded_by_id (uuid, nullable)

`run_library_link`
- run_id (uuid, fk)
- library_item_id (uuid, fk)
- relation (text)                -- used|created|promoted|superseded
- created_at (timestamptz)

## How "Created" vs "Utilized" Works
- Run detail computes counts per relation:
  - Used: link rows with `relation='used'`
  - Created: `relation='created'`
  - Promoted/Superseded: corresponding relations
- Run 1 expectation: Used=0, Created>0, Promoted>0
- Run 2 expectation: Used>0, Created small (only deltas), Promoted small

## Promotion Policy (Auto + Optional User Input)
- Default: auto-promote a small set of items after a successful run.
- If user provides input (edits/labels), store as `promotion_mode='user'`.
- Never delete; supersede older items by setting `superseded_by_id`.

